e flow\n\nImpact & Influenc\n• Positive impact on delivery outcomes across multiple consultant\n• Increased consistency and standards across the secto\n• Acting as a trusted point of expertise\n\nQuality & Standard\n• High and consistent standards of candidate qualit\n• Strong adherence to delivery processes\n\nCandidate Experienc\n• Consistent and professional candidate journey across the sector\n\nProfessional Standard\n• Accurate CRM usage and pipeline visibilit\n• Strong organisation and accountability\n\nBehaviours & Values Expected In This Role\n\nSector Leads are expected to demonstrate:\n\nSector Ownership – taking responsibility for delivery performance across the secto\nAccountability – driving activity, pipeline and standards across multiple role\nInfluence – improving delivery outcomes through guidance and suppor\nQuality Leadership – setting and maintaining high delivery standard\nConsistency – ensuring reliable and structured delivery performance\n\nThese behaviours form part of probation and promotion assessments.\n\nSector Leads are also expected to consistently demonstrate our 6 DNA values:\n\nDriven\nHow much do you want to achieve your goals?\n\nDisciplined\nConsistently performing the small actions required to achieve your goals.\n\nCompetitive\nSelf-motivated and driven to continually achieve your best.\n\nPositive\nMaintaining a solutions-focused attitude.\n\nResilient\nBouncing back quickly from setbacks.\n\nCommitted\nShowing dedication to achieving your goals and contributing to team success.\n\nAt Sector Lead level these values are demonstrated through ownership of sector performance, raising standards and influencing delivery outcomes across others.\n\n', E'2026-04-17T10:04:50.335298'),
