  (44, 2, E'Senior Recruitment Consultant Contract', 4, E'Senior Delivery Consultant – Contract\n\n\n\nPurpose Of The Role\n\nThe Senior Delivery Consultant is responsible for delivering high-quality contractors into recruitment processes while driving consistency, conversion and pipeline strength across contract roles.\n\nSenior Delivery Consultants operate independently, managing contractor pipelines, improving delivery outcomes and supporting contract revenue generation through effective candidate management and market understanding.\n\n\n\nRole Responsibilities\n\nContractor Delivery & Ownershi\n• Take full ownership of contractor delivery across multiple and complex role\n• Build and manage strong contractor pipelines aligned to role requirement\n• Deliver a consistent flow of relevant contractors into live processes\n\nContractor Qualification & Qualit\n• Conduct detailed qualification of contractor\n• Assess experience, availability, rate expectations and suitabilit\n• Ensure consistently high standards of contractor quality\n\nProcess Managemen\n• Manage contractors through the recruitment process from submission to onboardin\n• Coordinate interviews and maintain contractor engagemen\n• Anticipate and manage risks including drop-offs, availability changes and rate challenges\n\nPipeline & Market Managemen\n• Build and maintain structured contractor pipelines across roles and market\n• Develop strong understanding of contractor availability and market dynamic\n• Proactively identify and address pipeline gaps\n\nCollaboration & Influenc\n• Work closely with consultants to understand contract requirement\n• Provide insight on contractor markets, rates and availabilit\n• Influence delivery approach to improve outcomes\n\n\n\nWhat Success Looks Like – How The Role Is Measured\n\nDelivery Performanc\n• Consistently delivering high-quality contractors into live role\n• Supporting contract placements through effective deliver\n• Maintaining strong contractor pipeline coverage\n\nConversion & Qualit\n• Achieving strong CV to interview conversion rate\n• Supporting high interview to placement conversio\n• Delivering consistently relevant and well-qualified contractors\n\nSpeed & Efficienc\n• Delivering contractors within required timeframe\n• Maintaining momentum across contract processe\n• Managing multiple roles effectively\n\nActivity & Pipelin\n• Maintaining consistent sourcing and engagement activit\n• Building structured and sustainable contractor pipelines\n\nCandidate Experienc\n• Providing a professional contractor experienc\n• Managing expectations and communication effectively\n\nProfessional Standard\n• Maintaining accurate CRM and compliance record\n• Following contract recruitment processe\n• Operating with organisation and accountability\n\nBehaviours & Values Expected In This Role\n\nSenior Delivery Consultants are expected to demonstrate:\n\nOwnership – full responsibility for contractor delivery outcome\nAccountability – owning pipeline, activity and performanc\nQuality Focus – ensuring high standards of contractor suitabilit\nConsistency – delivering reliable performance over tim\nInfluence – contributing to improved delivery outcomes and decisions\n\nThese behaviours form part of probation and promotion assessments.\n\nSenior Delivery Consultants are also expected to consistently demonstrate our 6 DNA values:\n\nDriven\nHow much do you want to achieve your goals?\n\nDisciplined\nConsistently performing the small actions required to achieve your goals.\n\nCompetitive\nSelf-motivated and driven to continually achieve your best.\n\nPositive\nMaintaining a solutions-focused attitude.\n\nResilient\nBouncing back quickly from setbacks.\n\nCommitted\nShowing dedication to achieving your goals and contributing to team success.\n\nAt Senior level these values are demonstrated through consistent performance, reliability and influence on contract delivery outcomes.\n\n', E'2026-04-17T10:04:50.335298'),
